{"nusach":"edot_hamizrach","id":"mezuzah","sections":[{"title":{"he":"קביעת מזוזה","en":"Affixing a Mezuzah"},"segments":[{"key":"iEIbhteghd","he":[[{"t":"מצות עשה מן התורה לקבוע מזוזה, וצריך לקבוע אותה במזוזת ימין הנכנס בתוך חלל הפתח, ובטפח הסמוך לחוץ, ובתחילת שליש העליון של גובה השער (מלמטה למעלה), ותהיה זקופה לאורך, ולפני שיקבענה יברך","s":"n"}]],"en":"It is a positive commandment from the Torah to affix a mezuzah. And one must affix it to the right of one walking in through the space of the opening, in the handbreadth adjacent to the outside, at the beginning of the highest third of the height of the entrance (going upwards). And it should be erect lengthwise. Before he affixes it, he should recite the blessing:"},{"key":"33X5Gk7uVw","he":[[{"t":"לְשֵׁם יִחוּד קֻדְשָׁא בְּרִיךְ הוּא וּשְׁכִינְתֵּיהּ, בִּדְחִֽילוּ וּרְחִֽימוּ, וּרְחִֽימוּ וּדְחִֽילוּ, לְיַחֲדָא שֵׁם יוֹ\"ד קֵ\"א בְּוָא\"ו קֵ\"א בְּיִחוּדָא שְׁלִים, בְּשֵׁם כָּל־יִשְׂרָאֵל, הֲרֵֽינִי "},{"t":"בָּא לְקַיֵּם","voice":["male","unset"]},{"t":"בָּאָה לְקַיֵּם","voice":["female"]},{"t":" מִצְוַת עֲשֵׂה דְּאוֹרַיְתָא לִקְבֹּעַ מְזוּזָה כַּכָּתוּב וּכְתַבְתָּ֛ם עַל־מְזֻז֥וֹת בֵּיתֶ֖ךָ וּבִשְׁעָרֶֽיךָ׃ וִיהִ֤י ׀ נֹ֤עַם אֲדֹנָ֥י אֱלֹהֵ֗ינוּ עָ֫לֵ֥ינוּ וּמַעֲשֵׂ֣ה יָ֭דֵינוּ כּוֹנְנָ֥ה עָלֵ֑ינוּ וּֽמַעֲשֵׂ֥ה יָ֝דֵ֗ינוּ כּוֹנְנֵֽהוּ:"}],[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ","s":"b"},{"t":" אַתָּה יְהֹוָה, אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ מֶלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם, אֲשֶׁר קִדְּשָׁנוּ בְּמִצְוֹתָיו וְצִוָּנוּ לִקְבֹּעַ מְזוּזָה:"}]],"en":"For the sake of the Union of the Holy One, blessed be He, with His Divine Presence, with fear and love, and love and fear, to unite the Name of Yod Hay with Vav Hay in complete unity in the name of all Israel - behold I have come to fulfill the positive commandment from the Torah to affix a mezuzah, as it is written (Deuteronomy 6:9), \"And you shall write them upon the doorposts of your house and upon your gates.\" May the pleasantness of my Master, our God, be upon us, and the work of our hands establish for us and the work of our hands may He establish. Blessed are You, Lord our God, King of the Universe, who sanctified us with His commandments and commanded us to affix a mezuzah."},{"key":"TtRdW4lX8n","he":[[{"t":"ואחר שיקבענה ינשקנה ויאמר","s":"n"}]],"en":"And after he has affixed it, he should kiss it and say:"},{"key":"RrXivm__j8","he":[[{"t":"זֶה־הַשַּׁ֥עַר","s":"b"},{"t":" לַיהֹוָ֑ה צַ֝דִּיקִ֗ים יָבֹ֥אוּ בֽוֹ׃"}]],"en":"This is the gate of the Lord, the righteous shall come through it! (Psalms 118:20)"}]}],"credits":[{"title":"Siddur Edot HaMizrach — Shaliehsaboo Edition","license":"CC0","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Siddur_Edot_HaMizrach"},{"title":"Siddur Edot HaMizrach — Sefaria Community Translation","license":"CC0","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Siddur_Edot_HaMizrach"}]}